  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Creator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To download the model files of Catmaw AFV - Model Car For SCX10 and obtain detailed information, please visit the Catmaw AFV - Model Car For SCX10 on MakerWorld."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Overview</h3>\nThis product contains all the necessary hardware components for assembling a <strong>Catmaw AFV - Model Car For SCX10</strong>. To complete the assembly for an entirely functional piece, users also need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts.</div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><br/></div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<span data-mce-style=\"text-decoration: underline;\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span data-mce-style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\" style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span data-mce-style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\" style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: start;\" style=\"text-align: start;\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\"><br/></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\">To download the model files of <strong>Catmaw AFV - Model Car For SCX10 </strong>and obtain detailed information, please visit the <strong>Catmaw AFV - Model Car For SCX10</strong> on <a data-mce-href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/621348?from=search#profileId-545386\" href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/621348?from=search#profileId-545386\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-mce-style=\"color: #00ae42;\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><u>MakerWorld</u></strong></span></a>.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\"><br/></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 第三条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><br/></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 第四条 -->\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">In the Box</h3>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" data-mce-style=\"width: 100%; height: 274.313px;\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 274.313px;\">\n<!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<!-- 第一行 --><!-- 第二行 -->\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-style=\"height: 19.5938px;\" style=\"height: 19.5938px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"width: 83.2887%; height: 19.5938px;\" style=\"width: 83.2887%; height: 19.5938px;\"><strong>Item</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"width: 13.7916%; height: 19.5938px;\" style=\"width: 13.7916%; height: 19.5938px;\"><strong>Qty</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<!-- 第三行 -->\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-style=\"height: 19.5938px;\" style=\"height: 19.5938px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"width: 83.2887%; height: 19.5938px;\" style=\"width: 83.2887%; height: 19.5938px;\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\">\n<div class=\"old-record-id-WN9wdvxjroLLKUxZrwrcWzjZnhd\">4x2 mm Round Magnet (20PCS) - CA001</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"lark-record-clipboard\" data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"Button\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+6\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7118919285765865474\"]},\"nextNum\":1}},\"type\":\"text\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":64,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":6},\"recordId\":\"WN9wdvxjroLLKUxZrwrcWzjZnhd\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCut\":false}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx/text\"></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"width: 13.7916%; height: 19.5938px;\" style=\"width: 13.7916%; height: 19.59